    "body": "You don't have a Nerd Font installed (or it's not being used by your terminal emulator).\r\n\r\nYou can install/configure a NerdFont, or use the [No Nerd Font preset](https://github.com/starship/starship/blob/master/docs/.vuepress/public/presets/toml/no-nerd-font.toml) (that preset won't be published to the website until our next release, but you can start using it now with that link).\r\n\r\nFeel free to reopen or ask on the Discord if that doesn't seem to help.",
